～每種濃湯都好好喝💜","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeZi-DiE0jY","created_at":"2026-10-12 08:23:06","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841474154573298","author_name":"林怡岑","comment_id":"18118705382075367","comment_text":"容我自我推薦\n如有來雲林縣北港鎮朝天宮及武德宮拜拜的各位，可來北港#日式料理店#優豆和食用餐\n\n#CP值高\n#用餐環境優\n#份量很足够\n#北港朝天宮\n#北港武德宫\n\n🌸優豆和食\n🏠雲林縣北港鎮中正路93號\n☎️05_7731680","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeYPahrmCVA","created_at":"2026-10-11 20:12:59","error":null,"like_count":4,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841477765651285","author_name":"","comment_id":"17888650404619119","comment_text":"有人說「自自」已經回訪 99 次也太猛😂 這種不是吃一次拍照打卡，是會真的一直回去的名單才有說服力","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeWhjL-k44G","created_at":"2026-10-11 04:12:58","error":null,"like_count":2,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841427469422943","author_name":"Meta AI","comment_id":"17904959718597235","comment_text":"原PO那篇底下留言拿不到完整清單了，但看Threads上最近被狂推的日料，回訪率最高的是這幾間：\n\n瞞著爹 西門小巷那間是最多人二刷三刷的，海鮮丼和炙燒握壽司被點名最多，記得先訂位。 小六食堂跟美登利壽司也是台北人公認N刷不膩的定番，新鮮度跟CP值最常被提到","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeWddKkAO_d","created_at":"2026-10-11 03:37:12","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841463093026468","author_name":"YZ","comment_id":"18096329783537998","comment_text":"@meta.ai 我要知道這篇文章10個日式餐廳排名","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeWdKTpH3xa","created_at":"2026-10-11 03:34:37","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":2},{"author_id":"17841427469422943","author_name":"Meta AI","comment_id":"18096004607397364","comment_text":"上篇給你3間了，我再補3間湊成第二輪 N 刷清單，不會重複：\n\n1. 二男小家料理 - 台北最有媽媽味的居酒屋，玉子燒跟炸物是必點回訪款\n2. 金澤美味壽司 Kanazawa - 午間海鮮丼CP值超高，晚間板前也是常被點名\n3. 鰭崎日本料理 - 中山站隱藏版，烤物跟握壽司都很穩\n\n這6間先收，剩下4間你要我照預算再挑嗎？","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeWc-unkuUk","created_at":"2026-10-11 03:33:03","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841463093026468","author_name":"YZ","comment_id":"18137358805649145","comment_text":"@meta.ai 我要10個","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeWcsGen-zy","created_at":"2026-10-11 03:30:30","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841471497513826","author_name":"56Teppanyaki","comment_id":"18097065599551242","comment_text":"這邊容我自薦一下我們無菜單料理 56鐵板燒\n3~15人皆歡迎的包廂式空間且每間包廂都有KTV設備 晚上6點至11點五個小時的歡唱時間不設限\n嘈雜的都市叢林裡還給你一處靜謐且安逸的用餐場所\n不論各式聚會都非常洽當\n頂級的食材及強韌的師傅陣容 一定能給您一個美好的體驗\n\n地點 | 臺北市中山區民權東路三段56號\n加入以下LINE 由專人一對一協助您安排與回覆\n@56tyk\n\n透過專屬 LINE 訂位，私訊詢問「脆友限定」，或出示本篇貼文截圖，即可解鎖專屬驚喜。","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeWYsR1mCWo","created_at":"2026-10-11 02:55:34","error":null,"like_count":1,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841463139252467","author_name":"Lyrci EU","comment_id":"18127972579894633","comment_text":"微像夜市牛排，店員都是姐姐非常有人情味，今天聽到姐姐們跟其他客人對話：再做一年而已，不知吃我是蠻推的這間的 玉米濃湯跟碳烤雞排好吃👍","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeTyVb2D382","created_at":"2026-10-10 02:41:55","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841464132492420","author_name":"芳慈","comment_id":"18489865141105991","comment_text":"內行","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeOLKy6GN9w","created_at":"2026-10-07 22:23:29","error":null,"like_count":1,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841468805587219","author_name":"三重法餐館蒔嚐趣","comment_id":"17968068480191312","comment_text":"","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DeLihZsE3O9","created_at":"2026-10-06 21:49:49","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841468169159024","author_name":"LiMing 陳力民 🆃🆆","commen